# The frontend needs no environment variables.
#
# It only talks to the backend under /api on its own origin:
# - dev: `npm run dev` proxies /api to the backend on http://localhost:8080
#   (see vite.config.ts), so start the backend first;
# - production: serve the built `dist/` and the backend behind one domain
#   (compose.yaml: nginx routes /api → backend, everything else → frontend).
#
# 42 credentials, the OAuth redirect URI and PUBLIC_URL live in backend/.env.
